From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] pdfcraft: Cargo.lock for zip 9.8.1

zip 9.3.0 (suite-core, 0901-0903) to 9.8.1 in Cargo.lock: one zip version in every lock (RUSTSEC-2026-0545, -0548 apply to < 9.0.0;
the bump keeps pdfcraft on the version the other engines carry). Adds constant_time_eq.
---
